age":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":27143,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":18135,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["autograd","deep-learning","gpu","machine-learning","neural-network","numpy","python","tensor"],"visibility":"public","forks":27143,"open_issues":18135,"watchers":98201,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/pulls/154117","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/154117","diff_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/154117.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/154117.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #152008 \r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a segmentation fault that occurred when exiting the program due to improper background thread management in CachingHostAllocator.\r\n\r\nPreviously, the background thread continued running and called process_events() even after the allocator object was destroyed, leading to a crash on exit.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/f12d8d60b19083123d810ebda1eb1591dbe3dd3d/aten/src/ATen/core/CachingHostAllocator.h#L218\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n// Launch the background thread and process events in a loop.\r\nstatic bool background_thread_flag [[maybe_unused]] = [this] {\r\n  getBackgroundThreadPool()->run([&]() {\r\n    while (true) {\r\n      process_events();  // <-- This line may cause segfault on exit\r\n      std::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::microseconds(100));\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n  return true;\r\n}();\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe fix adds a mechanism to signal the background thread to exit before the object is destructed, ensuring the thread stops safely.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/154117/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/154117/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":17803516248,"node_id":"CE_lADOA-j9z86zoN76zwAAAAQlLBlY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/events/17803516248","actor":{"login":"pytorchmergebot","id":97764156,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdPDPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97764156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorchmergebot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pytorchmergebot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":"c4ef4090c578012c5739afe3da5718995080c484","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/c4ef4090c578012c5739afe3da5718995080c484","created_at":"2025-05-25T07:46:16Z","state_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":17803526654,"node_id":"REFE_lADOA-j9z86zoN76zwAAAAQlLEH-","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/events/17803526654","acto